WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.438
Let’s walk through Complete the handoff.

00:00:02.438 --> 00:00:05.562
Pause before submission and compare the projected discussion with the

00:00:05.562 --> 00:00:07.213
forwarded source record.

00:00:07.213 --> 00:00:10.225
Confirm team agreement, active move, completeness, and

00:00:10.225 --> 00:00:11.475
lifecycle state;

00:00:11.475 --> 00:00:13.975
projection alone is never submission.

00:00:13.975 --> 00:00:16.238
On this slide, confirm the Scribe record, the

00:00:16.238 --> 00:00:19.000
room’s agreement, the active move, and the explicit

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.962
White Cell submission state.

00:00:20.962 --> 00:00:24.137
In practice, the Facilitator owns the quality and timing

00:00:24.137 --> 00:00:25.262
of the handoff;

00:00:25.262 --> 00:00:28.212
White Cell owns review and adjudication.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:31.535
Before you continue, verify these points:

00:00:31.535 --> 00:00:34.160
Do not infer submission from projection.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:38.160
Use activity and communications to resolve new inputs.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:41.635
Start Here remains available above the session label.

00:00:41.635 --> 00:00:45.285
Use the highlighted Session reference area as your visual reference

00:00:45.285 --> 00:00:47.010
while you complete this check.
